---@alias gcp.unstable.playdeveloperreporting_v1alpha1.GooglePlayDeveloperReportingV1alpha1FreshnessInfoFreshnessList gcp.unstable.playdeveloperreporting_v1alpha1.GooglePlayDeveloperReportingV1alpha1FreshnessInfoFreshness[]

